    {
      "text": "City of San Jose permit H23-027 (Site Development Permit/Amendment, folder year 2023), status Approved, issue date 2025-03-19: \"Site Development Permit to allow the demolition of an existing vacant building (restaurant) and the construction of a six-story mixed-use project with approximately 3,804 square feet of commercial space and 41 housing units on and removal of one ordinance\" (city text cut off at 255 characters)",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001956"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Six-story mixed-use building, 41 units with 147 bedrooms, on a 0.44-acre site at the northwest corner of E Santa Clara St and N 12th St, replacing a vacant restaurant building (about 4,300 sq ft) formerly occupied by Vung Tau. Enclosed garage reached from N 12th St; ground-level courtyard 1,237 sq ft and second-floor podium courtyard 2,647 sq ft.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003569",
        "SRC-003566",
        "SRC-003568"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Sale timing: SF YIMBY (Sept. 7, 2025) says Tripalink purchased the lot on August 25th for $2.9 million; Global Student Living (Sept. 8, 2025) says the site was acquired for $2.9 million in August 2024. MLS listing ML82018582 (Marcus & Millichap) shows Sold at $2,900,000 and describes the site as approved for a 41-unit student housing development.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-003566",
